{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Break free from robot prison!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You're two escaped robots, still chained together, piloting a stolen spaceship through deadly obstacles. Security ships are chasing you, lasers are spinning, and that chain keeps getting tangled! Coordinate every move with your partner or crash together. Can you trust each other enough to escape?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Co-op Required: You need a partner to escape!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Invite a friend to break out with you. This isn't a solo mission - you're chained together, and you'll need each other to survive the chaos!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4100990/extras/bcad3ef5c98a8ff6fbc64c928ce38ac9.poster.avif?t=1762367428\" width=1170 height=498 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4100990/extras/bcad3ef5c98a8ff6fbc64c928ce38ac9.webm?t=1762367428\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4100990/extras/bcad3ef5c98a8ff6fbc64c928ce38ac9.mp4?t=1762367428\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Coordinate or Crash</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When you move in sync, you're unstoppable. When you don't? Hilarious disasters happen. The chain creates both epic teamwork moments and chaotic failures!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4100990/extras/4f14a516586b6785ba0d9dea6af879e7.poster.avif?t=1762367428\" width=1170 height=498 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4100990/extras/4f14a516586b6785ba0d9dea6af879e7.webm?t=1762367428\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4100990/extras/4f14a516586b6785ba0d9dea6af879e7.mp4?t=1762367428\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Chain Physics: Your bond is your biggest challenge</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You're physically connected by a chain that can tangle, stretch, and pull. Work together smoothly or watch as the chain trips you both up. Communication is everything!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Emotes: Express yourself mid-chaos!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Celebrate a perfect dodge, panic when things go wrong, or just mess with your partner. Emotes add personality to your escape - use them wisely (or not)!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4100990/extras/0907b10362f083e0407072cc236453bd.poster.avif?t=1762367428\" width=1170 height=498 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4100990/extras/0907b10362f083e0407072cc236453bd.webm?t=1762367428\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4100990/extras/0907b10362f083e0407072cc236453bd.mp4?t=1762367428\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>3 Unique Levels</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Prison Break</strong> - Escape from the robot detention facility </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>UFO Heist</strong> - Steal your getaway ship and take off</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Space Chase</strong> - Navigate through space while security hunts you down</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>One Difficulty, Maximum Fun</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No difficulty modes - just pure, unfiltered co-op chaos. Every run is a test of trust, timing, and how well you can yell instructions at your friend!</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4100990?t=1762367428","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4100990?t=1762367428","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4100990/455087220e38c616ea0fc026a2e89d44b79d0a0f/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1762367428","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4100990/455087220e38c616ea0fc026a2e89d44b79d0a0f/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1762367428","categories":[{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Break free from robot prison!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You're two escaped robots, still chained together, piloting a stolen spaceship through deadly obstacles. Security ships are chasing you, lasers are spinning, and that chain keeps getting tangled! Coordinate every move with your partner or crash together. Can you trust each other enough to escape?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Co-op Required: You need a partner to escape!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Invite a friend to break out with you. This isn't a solo mission - you're chained together, and you'll need each other to survive the chaos!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4100990/extras/bcad3ef5c98a8ff6fbc64c928ce38ac9.poster.avif?t=1762367428\" width=1170 height=498 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4100990/extras/bcad3